text:
Too many ads, no audio. UPDATE;

Reached castle level 53, all spells unlocked for all of the free characters. Now the game is impossible to advance. A new paid-character is probably required. I’m pretty much done with this. Charging $20+ for ONE character is greedy. Screw this game. 



I dont mind ads but when when they interrupt this frequently, you are obviously nagging for $ ie wanting us to pay to remove the ads. Does the designer need to be this obvious about their cash grab? Everything is also WAY overpriced. $6 to remove ads? $10-$30+ for other characters. Sorry, this game isnt that great. And btw, fix the audio. Your stupid, overly frequent ads kill the game audio. The ad audio works but it wipes out the audio in this cash-grab game.

>++. A1(+, derivativeness’, 
Quantitative-ie;
Mediocre approachable and non-mundane semi-typical genre.
Horrific, miserable; 
Very recommend,
